> On Sat, 17 Oct 2026 03:32:30 -0700, Pat Maddox <pat@patmaddox.com> wrote:
>> Of course I know I can type -inbox, but I want to know if that status
>> will get synced to Fastmail. Otherwise it might just pick it up again.
>
> It will not reach Fastmail, and it would not last even locally. A
> notmuch tag lives only in the notmuch database. With flag sync on,
> notmuch mirrors five tags to maildir flags (draft, flagged, passed,
> replied, and unread), and inbox is not one of them. Our configs keep
> flag sync off anyway.

